description: Never commit markdown files; keep *.md gitignored
alwaysApply: true
---

# Markdown files stay out of git

- All `*.md` files are gitignored in this repo.
- When you create a new `.md` file, do not stage or commit it.
- Do not remove `*.md` from `.gitignore` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer putting local docs under `docs/` (still ignored by `*.md`).
